":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"reEis"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c6b9e7d-2d09-4344-8b3f-48d1b1016ca8","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"N度目の(e)lisp入門しようかな、、オススメの本とかあるのですかね。","ts":"1622457685.068600","edited":{"user":"U022TD5GGKE","ts":"1622457779.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9w1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BC204E40-BFF4-4252-8552-BF0A004C00FC","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕がEmacsに復帰した時に感じた内容です。","ts":"1622456966.067700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xl5t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8C1C1105-0482-4D9B-BA2F-D04F49C460B2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://blog.tomoya.dev/posts/switch-to-emacs-from-atom/|https://blog.tomoya.dev/posts/switch-to-emacs-from-atom/\u003e","ts":"1622456921.066900","attachments":[{"fallback":"AtomからEmacsに乗り換えて気付いたEmacsの底力","id":1,"title":"AtomからEmacsに乗り換えて気付いたEmacsの底力","title_link":"https://blog.tomoya.dev/posts/switch-to-emacs-from-atom/","text":"2018年の年末にAtomからEmacsにスイッチしてしようと決めてから、年末年始を利用して快適にコードが編集できるようにEmacsを鍛えて","image_url":"https://blog.tomoya.dev/posts/switch-to-emacs-from-atom/emacs-20190128.png","blocks":null,"ts":1548650939,"service_name":"blog.tomoya.dev","service_icon":"https://blog.tomoya.dev/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://blog.tomoya.dev/posts/switch-to-emacs-from-atom/","original_url":"https://blog.tomoya.dev/posts/switch-to-emacs-from-atom/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eqB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7219454-320c-4064-9d0c-578fe63353c1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"やはりマクロが強力です。そもそもLispがシンプルなので、目的に応じて様々なDSLを自分で作ることができます。\nこういう記事も。 \u003chttps://muuumin.net/why-lisp-god-language/\u003e","ts":"1622455449.066400","attachments":[{"fallback":"SEむううみんのプログラミングパラダイス -: Lispはなぜ神の言語と呼ばれるのか - SEむううみんのプログラミングパラダイス","id":1,"title":"Lispはなぜ神の言語と呼ばれるのか - SEむううみんのプログラミングパラダイス","title_link":"https://muuumin.net/why-lisp-god-language/","text":"2021/04/25 もともとは川合史朗氏の記事を紹介して終わっていたのですが、大幅に追記しました。 ---- … 続きを読む →","blocks":null,"ts":1617725964,"service_name":"SEむううみんのプログラミングパラダイス -","service_icon":"https://muuumin.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/xt6Gnurk_400x400-300x300.jpg","from_url":"https://muuumin.net/why-lisp-god-language/","original_url":"https://muuumin.net/why-lisp-god-language/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":3,"users":["U01U44T1FK2","U022TD5GGKE","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HZ0/h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"927d6714-5dd1-4e87-bdf6-2e50de8a5b29","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Lispが良いぞって感じです。Lispは取っつき辛いですが、慣れてしまうと抜けれない良さがあります。","ts":"1622455343.066200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AuN+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d674ac6f-5a62-423e-97ca-4165d03390d2","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; Elispが動くことですねー\n\u0026gt; \nこれってElispはいいぞーって感じですかね\n\n一つの式に設定を詰め込めるのは魅力かも","ts":"1622455049.066000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9u3z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf18ab0f-83e2-4673-a7e5-a01cd72f6a59","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/jwiegley/use-package\u003e\nuse-packageでパッケージを設定できること。\n視認性の面から1つのパッケージの設定を1つの式で書きたいです。自由なDSLを定義できる (つまり自分のuse-packageが作れる) ことも重要です。","ts":"1622454607.065600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: jwiegley/use-package","id":1,"title":"jwiegley/use-package","title_link":"https://github.com/jwiegley/use-package","text":"A use-package declaration for simplifying your .emacs - jwiegley/use-package","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/622ceb59189b0a745f8786eacc8a539c398010b09081ce360a8